{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins underground. A crowded subway station erupts into chaos as a mysterious virus spreads, turning ordinary people into the infected. Panic fills the dark tunnels, streets are abandoned, and the city falls into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few survivors. To live, you must fight your way through bloodthirsty zombies, mutated creatures, and horrors born from the outbreak\u2014all while searching for the truth behind its rapid spread. Resources are limited, the odds are against you, and every decision could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OUTBREAK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned subway tunnels, ruined streets, and hidden facilities to discover the origins of the virus and whether it can be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL HORROR GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources, solve environmental puzzles, and use the safety of Save Rooms and Item Storage wisely to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE NIGHTMARE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From relentless zombies to twisted mutations and nightmare-fuel creatures, every enemy requires a different strategy to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1052 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of weapons and equipment to fight or escape. Unlock secrets and upgrades as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1082 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERIC EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in detailed environments and an original soundtrack inspired by the survival horror classics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Gameplay features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich action and interaction design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Room and Item Storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All types of enemies from blood thirsty zombies, mutated fauna to other nightmare fuel creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game unlockable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive OST inspired by the Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed visual rendering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons and equipment system,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outbreak Zero</i> is developed by a <strong>solo indie developer passionate about survival horror</strong>. Inspired by Survival Horror classics games, the goal is to bring back the tense, atmospheric, and cinematic experience that fans of the genre love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent project, community feedback is vital. Every comment, Wishlist, and bit of support helps shape <i>Outbreak Zero</i> into the best game it can be.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669190?t=1764835076","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/dc06c0d0a63c64c48e8c85246d29eb4e7e133390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764835076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/924978cf10c5f2a0b3a62e3ffc27cebfa442d154/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764835076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/924978cf10c5f2a0b3a62e3ffc27cebfa442d154/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764835076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Outbreak Zero contains frequent scenes of violence and gore, including blood effects, combat encounters, and depictions of injury. The content is stylized and not excessively graphic but may still be inappropriate for younger audiences."},"demos":[{"appid":3915990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins underground. A crowded subway station erupts into chaos as a mysterious virus spreads, turning ordinary people into the infected. Panic fills the dark tunnels, streets are abandoned, and the city falls into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few survivors. To live, you must fight your way through bloodthirsty zombies, mutated creatures, and horrors born from the outbreak\u2014all while searching for the truth behind its rapid spread. Resources are limited, the odds are against you, and every decision could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OUTBREAK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned subway tunnels, ruined streets, and hidden facilities to discover the origins of the virus and whether it can be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/8f3ebb4f8e68ab0641c622ade60cfb49.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL HORROR GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources, solve environmental puzzles, and use the safety of Save Rooms and Item Storage wisely to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1428 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/dc8b5a25eb50b70dbbe2b9c0b629f334.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE NIGHTMARE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From relentless zombies to twisted mutations and nightmare-fuel creatures, every enemy requires a different strategy to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1052 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/47fd80c74246da8fa0aeca6b980eb357.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of weapons and equipment to fight or escape. Unlock secrets and upgrades as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.poster.avif?t=1764835076\" width=1082 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.webm?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/1a07dd291d75939b8753c819a74a7c5d.mp4?t=1764835076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/extras/f81a21b876718070b69840b88e2756ce.webp?t=1764835076\" width=758 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERIC EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in detailed environments and an original soundtrack inspired by the survival horror classics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Gameplay features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich action and interaction design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Room and Item Storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All types of enemies from blood thirsty zombies, mutated fauna to other nightmare fuel creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game unlockable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive OST inspired by the Classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed visual rendering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons and equipment system,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Outbreak Zero</i> is developed by a <strong>solo indie developer passionate about survival horror</strong>. Inspired by Survival Horror classics games, the goal is to bring back the tense, atmospheric, and cinematic experience that fans of the genre love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent project, community feedback is vital. Every comment, Wishlist, and bit of support helps shape <i>Outbreak Zero</i> into the best game it can be.</p>","developers":["Next Generation Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669190/6eeee36fd1c4864d203fd357463290f519bfc1a5/header.jpg?t=1764835076","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>R